<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκω</span></b>  (akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span>), only imper., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκ᾽ ἴθι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speed thee! away!</i> II.<i><span class="en">
				2.8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκετ᾽, ἐπείγετε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					783
				</span></i>
			; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκε</span>”
				<i>come!</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					663
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				671
			</span></i> (both lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκ᾽, ἄλαστε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Mim. Oxy.</u>
					413.60
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάσκου: πορεύου</span> is prob.
				f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
